@LocationServer_HostAddress = http://localhost:5180

### 1. Register User Public Key (Auth Endpoint)
# Registers the derived 32-byte public key associated with the user's account key
POST {{LocationServer_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/register-key
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_DEVICE_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "signing_public_key": "a1b2c3d4e5f678901234567890abcdef1234567890abcdef1234567890abcdef"
}

###

### 2. Register Device / Create User (Admin Endpoint)
# Returns deviceToken (bearer token) used for client authentication
POST {{LocationServer_HostAddress}}/admin/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Dad"
}

###

### 3. Send Location Update (Public API Endpoint)
# Updates user location encrypted with the current group key
POST {{LocationServer_HostAddress}}/api/v1/location/update
Content-Type: application/json
X-Device-Token: YOUR_DEVICE_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "encryptedPayload": "base64_or_hex_cipher_text",
  "keyVersion": 1,
  "timestamp": "2026-09-05T12:00:00Z"
}

###

### 4. Fetch Live Family Map Feed
GET {{LocationServer_HostAddress}}/api/v1/location/feed
X-Device-Token: YOUR_DEVICE_TOKEN_HERE
Accept: application/json

###

### 5. Check User Status & Pending Key Rotations
# Checks active group memberships and pending key rotation payloads
GET {{LocationServer_HostAddress}}/api/v1/location/status
X-Device-Token: YOUR_DEVICE_TOKEN_HERE
Accept: application/json

###

### 6. Get Group Keys (Client Key Distribution)
# Retrieves latest key versions and encrypted PSK envelopes for active groups
GET {{LocationServer_HostAddress}}/api/v1/groups/keys
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_DEVICE_TOKEN_HERE
Accept: application/json

###

### 7. Rotate Group Key (Client Relay)
# Relays HMAC-signed rotation payload generated by client to group members
POST {{LocationServer_HostAddress}}/api/v1/location/rotate-key
Content-Type: application/json
X-Device-Token: YOUR_DEVICE_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "groupId": "YOUR_GROUP_GUID_HERE",
  "newKeyVersion": 2,
  "encryptedNewKey": "base64_encrypted_passphrase",
  "signature": "hmac_signature_string"
}

###

### 8. Create a Group (Admin Endpoint)
POST {{LocationServer_HostAddress}}/admin/groups
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Family"
}

###

### 9. Get All Groups and Members (Admin Endpoint)
GET {{LocationServer_HostAddress}}/admin/groups
Accept: application/json

###

### 10. Assign User to Group (Admin Endpoint)
POST {{LocationServer_HostAddress}}/admin/groups/assign
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "groupId": "YOUR_GROUP_GUID_HERE",
  "userId": 1
}

###

### 11. Remove User from Group (Admin Endpoint)
POST {{LocationServer_HostAddress}}/admin/groups/remove
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "groupId": "YOUR_GROUP_GUID_HERE",
  "userId": 1
}